# My Recipe — always-on

- Workflow (5 stages: ①→⑤): `docs/development/workflow.md`
- Product scope: `docs/product/vision.md`
- Feature acceptance contracts: `docs/product/features/`
- Architecture: `docs/architecture/overview.md`
- Steering map: `docs/development/steering.md`
- Task procedures: `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md`
- Do not start feature implementation (④) until the feature doc header has a human **承認者** and 状態 is **承認済み** or later — drafting/reviewing the doc is not approval; 「ワークフローに沿って」 alone is not either
- Do not merge to production without human approval (deploy policy D1)
- After a feature is L4-accepted or merged, run **⑤ retrospective** without waiting to be asked — put recurring risks into skill / rule / workflow (not only the feature doc)
- Keep agent prompts short; put behavior details in feature docs
- Next.js 16: read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before unfamiliar APIs. `cookies()`/`headers()` are async. Use `proxy.ts`, not `middleware.ts`.
- New Supabase tables need RLS **and** `grant` for `anon`/`authenticated`.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env*` except `.env.example`).
- Keep diffs scoped; update `docs/` in the same PR when behavior or scope changes.
